  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 413.03 Refund Procedure",
  "priorExpiration": "2003-12-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 413.03 Refund Procedure.\n\n(a) A person shall be sent a blank certificate of course completion along with the notice of the requirement for a $200 administrative penalty, pursuant to RSA 270:46-a.\n\n(b) Any person who has completed an approved boat safety course within 6 months of the date of conviction, shall forward a certificate of course completion issued by the course instructor along with a letter to the director.\n\n(c) The letter required by (b) above shall include the following information:\n\n(1) Name;\n\n(2) Current mailing address;\n\n(3) Name of organization that conducted the course;\n\n(4) Title of the course;\n\n(5) Date the course was completed; and\n\n(6) Date the person was notified by the state of New Hampshire to pay the $200 administrative penalty.\n\n(d) Upon receipt of the information set forth in (c) above, the division shall send a check, in the amount of $200, to the person who was required to pay the administrative penalty.\n\nSource. #4715, eff 12-5-89; ss by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES, 5-3-95; ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8172, eff 9-21-04; (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading) renumbered by #9544 (formerly Saf-C 412.03); ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
